flowchart TD
SimulationModel["**Simulation Model**<br/>Attributes env raw_input sink defects delay_buffers machines_list<br/>Methods run_simulation seed warmup measure_until sample_wip reset_machine_stats"]
DelayBuffer["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap delay store tokens _in_transit<br/>Methods put get in_transit_count free_capacity _delayed_put _get_and_release"]
Machine["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power resource is_up working_time failed_time_total wait_input_time blocked_time active_count processed_count window_wait_time<br/>Methods run _breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
ParameterSpace["**Parameter Space**<br/>Attributes buffer_names bounds {1-5} discrete<br/>Methods enumerate_candidates map_genes_to_buffers"]
Individual["**Individual**<br/>Attributes genes buffer_capacities dict fitness_throughput fitness_wip dominated_flag<br/>Methods evaluate mutate crossover encode decode"]
MOO_Optimizer["**MOO Optimizer**<br/>Attributes population_size generations objectives {wip min throughput max} algorithm NSGA2_like selection mutation crossover<br/>Methods initialize_population evaluate_population select_and_evolve run get_pareto_front"]
SimulationRunner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>Attributes seed_schedule warmup measure_until parallel_workers<br/>Methods run_case run_batch map_individual_to_simulation collect_metrics"]
FitnessEvaluator["**Fitness Evaluator**<br/>Attributes objective_weights transform_rules<br/>Methods compute_fitness from_metrics normalize handle_stochastic_replication"]
ResultCollector["**Result Collector**<br/>Attributes pareto_archive histories run_logs<br/>Methods update_archive save_snapshot export_results"]
ProductionManager["**Production Manager**<br/>Role consumes Pareto solutions selects candidate tradeoffs interprets KPIs"]

%% Data flow and interactions
MOO_Optimizer -->|initialize population| ParameterSpace
ParameterSpace -->|produce individuals| Individual
MOO_Optimizer -->|request evaluation of individuals| SimulationRunner
Individual -->|provide genes buffer capacities| SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner -->|instantiate or configure| SimulationModel
SimulationModel -->|uses classes| DelayBuffer
SimulationModel -->|uses classes| Machine
SimulationRunner -->|run run_simulation for seed schedule| SimulationModel
SimulationModel -->|return metrics throughput wip machine_energy| SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner -->|pass metrics| FitnessEvaluator
FitnessEvaluator -->|compute fitness values| MOO_Optimizer
MOO_Optimizer -->|evolve population| Individual
MOO_Optimizer -->|store nondominated solutions| ResultCollector
ResultCollector -->|present Pareto set| ProductionManager

%% Supporting flows for optimization loop
MOO_Optimizer -->|select candidates| Individual
Individual -->|crossover mutate| Individual
MOO_Optimizer -.->|stop criteria generations or budget| ResultCollector
ProductionManager -->|feedback constraint or preference| MOO_Optimizer

%% Notes on parameter mapping and constraints
ParameterSpace -.->|enforce discrete bounds {1-5}| SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner -.->|map genes to DelayBuffer cap attributes| SimulationModel

%% End of diagram